  "description": "The MelangeDB command-line tool. `melange schema` writes a module's client-visible schema manifest for the client binding generator, and `melange generate` turns a manifest into client bindings without a compiler (docs/CLIENT-BINDINGS.md). `melange backup` captures a data directory into a .mbak archive, `melange backup verify` proves the archive good, and `melange restore` materializes a data directory a server boots from (docs/BACKUP.md). `melange mcp` bridges a local agent's stdio to a running host's MCP endpoint (docs/MCP.md).",
